The projectional editor
description: the maintainer's map - projections, the pure machine, the write path, and yed
- >
  How the web client edits a yamlover node **in place**. This is the maintainer's map of the code
  under `tools/server/src/client/renderers/`; for the *user-facing* "how to drive it" guide see
  [operating the UI](::server:ui), and for the surgical write endpoint see
  `tools/server/README.md` (`POST /api/edit`).
- >
  Three abstract state machines accompany this chapter and must stay in sync with the code: [the
  yamlover editor](::server:yamlover-editor), [the chapter editor](::server:chapter-editor), and
  [the query editor](::server:query-editor) - see [the sync convention](::server:editor:machines).
